From 98efba3837eb96e2c1d53cf981c2f5ff98734266 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luc3as <luc3as@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 17:26:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/25] Follow up on a hot verdict that arrives after the alert

The enrichment loop held the alert for a while and then sent it as-is if no
verdict had come. A verdict landing a minute later was stored but never
mentioned, which is exactly the case where it matters most: the agent took
its time because the product was worth a proper look. Now a late verdict
that scores at least ENRICHMENT_HIGHLIGHT_SCORE (and does not call the
listing the wrong product) queues a short "verdict is in: hot deal"
follow-up to the same chat destinations. A late "nothing special" stays
quiet. Third notification kind, hence another outbox rebuild (0008).
